  "method": "Exact XZ segment intersections of turn centerlines, filtered for |height delta| <= 2.5 m; exclude pairs sharing incoming or outgoing travel lane. Candidate geometric conflicts only; not swept-vehicle collisions.",
  "notes": [
    "A long turn can cross another well beyond a short connector's required reservation release: content-only safety is insufficient.",
    "Overlook and Orchard are degree-two nodes with four actual crossings each, serialized by a late-release yield definition.",
    "A pass_through row can have geometric crossings only if the geometry changes; such a row must be reauthored before integration.",
    "The simulator lacks a per-turn conflict matrix; resolving late conflicts requires simulation evolution."
